<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places first direct Cetes sale.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places first direct Cetes sale.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of three direct sales sales it had offered on Tuesday as part of its planned intervention to drain a total of 4.294 billion pesos from the secondary market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Cetes sale was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	 TERM	 AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	150 million    359 days   23.05 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
